dsh-purge-optimized - derivative branch
https://github.com/lzzzz666888/dsh-purge-optimized

This repository is a derivative of dsh-purge 1.1.90 by HunYiSage.
The upstream copyright notice above is retained unchanged.

Changes in this branch, relative to upstream 1.1.90:
  - restores the skill library: 23 skills under skills/redteam/
  - re-enables the POC/EXP knowledge base (store dispatch + tools)
  - restores the local-lab allowlist write path and its settings panel
  - adds category filtering and pagination to the nuclei template index

Upstream network-scope rules (local-lab gate, DNS resolution check,
game-cheat detection, evidence-chain tools) are kept as-is.

